(label "VREG_AVDD" (at 45.72 256.54 270) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "733ae8e3-7cae-4e7a-b6be-9f40ac248721"))
(text "Mono: a slender console with no radio. See hardware/mono/README.md.\nEvery connection is a name: a net label or a power symbol at the end of each pin's stub." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ba097085-2ee0-4fbb-b5e5-bc30a397145d"))
(text "The link. The USB-C's D+ and D- reach the CH343P and nothing else.\nTXD/RXD go to UART1 (GPIO21/20). DTR and RTS are NOT connected,\non purpose: the computer can't reset the RP2350 or hold BOOTSEL.\nDon't add auto-reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 5.08 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "79591d86-19cf-42c3-a0d7-72df7cd7f27a"))
(text "The RP2350's regulator (L1, C1, C2, R1, C3) is Raspberry Pi's minimal design.\nCopy its layout and L1's orientation exactly (Hardware design with RP2350, 2.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 157.48 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dabae58a-bc87-48ee-aa30-565e773b5ab9"))
(text "J2: console-rp's pin order, which its board 1 shows a picture with." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 264.16 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c033b5c3-4b4d-4b1d-982e-7dbd20df1b53"))
(text "KEY 2: a second key's site, on I2C1 and VKEY, a supply of its own that is off at reset.\nU7 (Trust M, 0x30), U8 (608C, 0x60) and J4 are not fitted. Pull-ups to VKEY, never to 3V3.\nJ4: VKEY GND SCL SDA RST, Adafruit's breakouts' order. Meter before power." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 411.48 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c775ffa5-21df-47ff-aea7-944755743a00"))
(text "The jig's pads, on the back: SWD through 100R, RUN, 3V3, BOOT (to GND at reset for\nUSB boot), the RP2350's own USB through 27R, and ground. Nothing reaches them through the USB-C." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 411.48 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "913d830d-a2d0-41b0-a94f-016a034e7ad4"))
